cription":"11th Bangladesh Chemistry Olympiad 2020 preliminary round, held 27 August 2021. Competition year and event date are recorded separately.","icon":"Star","category":"Competition","date":"27 August 2021","color":"text-orange-500"},{"id":8,"title":"Industrial Attachment","subtitle":"BrainStation 23 PLC · 15 Days","description":"Completed the CSE 4108 industrial attachment in machine learning during March 2025.","icon":"Code","category":"Industry","date":"2025","color":"text-pink-500"},{"id":9,"title":"VBD Service Recognition","subtitle":"HR Officer · Rajshahi District","date":"1 January 2026","description":"Certificate of appreciation for Human Resource Officer service during 2025.","icon":"Award","category":"Community","color":"text-green-500"},{"id":10,"title":"FutureNation Recognition","subtitle":"Campus Volunteer","date":"16 February 2026","description":"Recognized for dedication to youth upskilling and community development.","icon":"Award","category":"Community","color":"text-blue-500"}]$json$::jsonb, updated_at = now() WHERE content_key = 'achievements';
UPDATE public.site_content SET content_value = $json${"current_roles":"Junior Software Engineer at Scalius Labs (September 2026–Present); Machine Learning & AI Instructor at Artificial Intelligence Bangladesh; Research Assistant at RUET; Fellow at The Earth (April 2026–Present); Alumni Affairs Advisor at RUET IoT Club and Computing Society alumni member since June 2026.","past_roles":"RUET IoT Club President (February 2025–June 2026); RUET Computing Society President (November 2025–June 2026); Aachol Foundation HR Executive (July 2025–June 2026). BCC Python training is documented for 2026; an ongoing appointment is not confirmed.","education":"B.Sc. in Computer Science & Engineering at RUET; degree conferred 11 August 2026 (2024 examination); session 2020–2021.","projects":"Traffic sign detection with YOLOv8, MobileNet and ResNet; Flutter/Firebase attendance management; SpotSync smart parking and EV charging API using Go, Echo, GORM and PostgreSQL; explainable adversarial intrusion detection using CNN-BiLSTM, IBM ART and SHAP. See Projects for repository links.","research":"Co-author of two ICCiT 2024 papers: A Cross-Analyzing Approach to Sentiment and Bias Detection in Social Media: Insights from Geopolitical Conflicts; Improving Monkeypox Outbreak Prediction Through Time-Series Forecasting with Machine Learning Models (XGBoost/LSTM/Prophet).","skills":"Python, C, C++, JavaScript, SQL, Dart; TensorFlow, PyTorch, Scikit-learn, Pandas, NumPy; React, Tailwind CSS, Node.js, Laravel; Flutter, Firebase, Git, Docker, Linux.","certifications":"Course completions include Claude 101, Google GenAI for Educators, Kaggle ML/DL, Duke/Coursera, Ostad, EDGE and UNDP. CAPM preparation is not a PMI certification; CCNA Jumpstart is not a Cisco CCNA certification. See Certifications for verified details.","contact":"Use the Contact section of this portfolio for engineering work, research collaborations, mentoring or speaking opportunities."}$json$::jsonb, updated_at = now() WHERE content_key = 'ai_profile';
